"""Compile editable inputs, not surfaces; existing GN computes every pavement.

Persistent topology lives in model PropertyGroups. Derived carriers store
replaceable topology bindings into the unchanged initial Step 2 group. The
saved GN groups sample actual source coordinates/attributes during evaluation;
ordinary edits need no registration or Python synchronization. Compilation and
managed topology edits prepare indices, never surface vertices or quad topology.
"""
